ame>Lubec</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Hayn</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Denk</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Bauer</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Brain lipid peroxidation and hydroxyl radical attack following the intravenous infusion of hydrogen peroxide in an infant</article-title><source>Free Radic Biol Med</source><year>1996</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>219</fpage><lpage>23</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8818637</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>